# The standard library beside PAX's lupin (R-px57-1(a), px61).
# wolf 0.2.34's release archive bundles e036bec; 3bacc5f is the next
# STD-PIN (sc69), explicitly selected for the installed source tree.
# /usr/share/wolf/std holds its std/ subtree, not the entire repository;
# /etc/shrc exports LUPIN_STD to that path. tools/fetch-std records every
# file in a sorted SHA256 manifest and hashes the manifest itself.
# px65: 78b9d3c (sc72), wolf 0.2.36's STD-PIN, the std at wolf 0.2.35 /
# lupin 0.1.56 (the 0.2.35 archive bundles 2386522e, sc70): s253's and
# s254's thirteen wrappers, the in-place list mutators, fs.read_into.
STD_REPO=https://github.com/wolffe-lang/wolf-std
STD_REV=78b9d3cbc41d51db44d18c40b6694403644d1c83
STD_PATH=/usr/share/wolf/std
